          "afterStart": 2,
          "afterEnd": 3,
          "afterLines": [
            "Status: **v3 SOURCE-ONLY minimum I2 revision pending independent source peer; package closure pending**. Fixed v2 formal review C0/I1/M0 remains not passed; its sole remaining I2 finding is the checked flag being mutable during native option processing. V3 changes only that private-copy descriptor and this report, with all other22 source files unchanged. These24 source files are not promoted to root or a runnable package. Fixed v1 remains unchanged and its formal review is **C0/I4/M1, not passed**. Historical feasibility/protocol-choice C0/I0/M0 reviews do not reduce that finding. This report is a static implementation proposal, not a successful isolation/compile/emit/test result. Release=false, activation=false, prepared invocations=0. No after/UI/business credit. Only Node `--check` and Python `ast.parse` syntax operations have been used on candidate tools. All new files are in this new scratch; the consumed prep2 package and repository remain inputs.\n"
